{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_03",
  "title": "光與影",
  "storyCode": "IW-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "10e9367469dfae66651d4a3c871853564f04b4339ac3512bc41e55238015618c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......東西不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情如果有這麼簡單，那我倒要擔心梁先生挑人的眼光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鄭前輩，關於那個龍門來客，身份可知曉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是梁洵的好友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有沒有什麼別的身份？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然有幾處模糊不清的線索，但至少有一事可做擔保，此事與魏公絕無聯繫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如此一來，家父最大的顧慮，也就不復存在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想來也是，若是以龍門魏公的手段......恐怕咱們現在，也別指望安安靜靜喝茶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早年聽聞過不少魏公逸聞，一直沒機會去龍門一睹風采，很可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到掌櫃的也會對魏公此等人物感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早年用刀，行走江湖。聽聞魏公劍法卓絕，如此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來是這樣。魏公確實佩劍......不過劍法一事，我也只聽聞過一些傳聞罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這樣的話，挑那個龍門人入局的，豈不變成了梁先生自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多半是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。那個龍門人是唯一的變數，也是梁先生唯一一枚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人本該是我們的人。他挑選的物件，也不該騙我，不該有這一記無理手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁先生也是個身不由己的苦人。要是......唉，也沒那麼多要是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不正是因為她在尚蜀，才搞出了這麼多麻煩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......三山十七峰，有仙則靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古時，尚蜀多夢，不僅人有夢，萬物皆夢中。俗話說，眾物有靈皆神仙，萬語千言只一呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳聞千年之前，那時的大炎城鎮分佈，與現代大不相同，尚蜀人的祖先們正是夢見了同一個夢，才來此地安居樂業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......尚蜀傳說總是如此悠揚壯美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外人看是傳說，本地人都覺得這是歷史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個醫療公司的幹員......是叫克洛絲來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若非鄭前輩接應，我怕真會在街上被她追上，還要謝過前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先前小女操之過急，險些誤事，我出手相助，算是補救，理所當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......羅德島到底是個變數。掌櫃怎麼看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "局外人罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他們離桌子太近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......其實那樣的身手可不多見，先前看她追逐時的動作，我心中已經有數了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大約是個什麼印象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年紀輕輕，身經百戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？這個身經百戰，是以鄭掌櫃的眼光來看，還是以問霜客鄭清鉞的眼光來看呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鄭前輩一直在看這隻假盞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在回憶......回憶那隻酒盞原本的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那年過荒野，遇到了一夥賊。荒野上的人，連大炎話都聽不懂，不知道是從哪裡冒出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們炸翻了車隊，想搶走貨物，但是被鏢局的同僚阻攔了。可劫匪人數眾多，賊心不死，一路尾隨了我們二百里地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時下大雨，視野模糊，燈火撲朔，那些熟悉地形的劫匪就像影子一樣黏在身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不敢反擊，怕暗箭。也不敢一股腦地沒命逃，怕逃不出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......晚輩只聽說，司歲台曾秘密委託名震一方的行裕鏢局，押運一件奇物。中途發生了意外，那物下落不明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不會說什麼安慰人的話語，鄭前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是沒想到，再一次遇到那麼咄咄逼人的弓弩好手，竟然是在我的家鄉，在城內，在一個燈火通明的夜晚，因為同一隻酒盞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實在是......一言難盡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......後來鄭前輩是如何脫險的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......自然是過去那次。家父說了，晚輩年輕，缺乏眼界閱歷，要多向各位前輩學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然前輩提起了，那晚輩自然洗耳恭聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那晚啊......只是運氣好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負傷的兩個好夥計，再沒能挺過來，瞑目了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鏢局的規矩是“先救貨，再救人”，既然做這行，就得有準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過隊伍裡沒了傷患，貨也未必保得住了，倒反而能放開手腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那晚雨大，正好洗刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到這隻酒盞的主人就好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所謂主人，是說買家或者收藏家一類的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算是，如果這麼簡單倒好辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，這就奇了怪了，雖說這酒盞確實便宜得嚇人，但根據從那些走私販手裡搶來的黑市鑑定報告來看，似乎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是件貨真價實的古董。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對方是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我還不知道對方的名字。不僅如此，它的主人是男是女，是何種族，又有多大年紀，都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......這要如何找起？人確定在尚蜀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有這一點毫無疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？萬一這個人出門遠遊一趟，我們不是要白費十天半個月的功夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那個人一定還停留在尚蜀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那個人離開過......那一定會有人通知我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稀奇。明明能一直監視對方，卻找不到他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道對方是什麼妖魔鬼怪或者得道神仙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你見到了，自然會明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多半是有什麼“他在這兒”的痕跡吧，這年頭當官的都要和這些玩意打交道了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行吧，你不說我也不多問了，只是這丁點線索......尚蜀那麼大，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多半藏在三山之中的某座山頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有說法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些。此人性情叵測，可極其偶爾會出現在一些山腰酒鋪買酒，毫無規律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過此人從未下山，也從未出現在移動城區之中。那麼多半是在山上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。三山十七峰，看來有的跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳說此人好良辰，好美景，更好臥居涼亭，吟詩作樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實不光是傳說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不算認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可眼下確實只能拼拼運氣，有勞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時限呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越快越好。你也看見，這件事牽扯的人很多，再拖下去，會節外生枝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有這隻酒盞。既然有人覬覦，還是放在我府上安全些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人果然厲害。先讓我不遠萬里把酒盞送來，然後要我找它的主人，卻又不把它給我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是梁大人這麼喜歡為難人，那下次，不如直接安排我在龍門幫你的忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是信得過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然有人盯上它了，我一直帶著，確實也有可能變成麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而說到行裕客棧那事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在查了。小心行事，如果有必要，我可以安排人手陪著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "免了，一大籮筐保鏢，人多眼雜反而麻煩，你心裡清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可你一個人真沒問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果梁大人沒有什麼事情還瞞著我，那就沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找個人嘛，又不是在龍門調查可怕的外國走私販，能有什麼麻煩的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還是和慎師傅打聲招呼吧。他是碼頭熟工，在尚蜀，去哪兒他都能幫上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，說起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚蜀三山十七峰裡，有攥江峰這麼一個山頭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你這傢伙，怎麼這麼難纏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為你是最後的線索嘛，哪能這麼容易讓你逃掉呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的那些小嘍囉都已經走散了喔，這麼繁華的市區，也不方便舞刀弄槍的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個龍門賊人給了你多少錢，你要這樣護他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我不清楚事情的全部經過，但鯉先生是我們重要的合作人之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "合作？聽著就像做生意的事，怎敢輕言信任？你就這麼確定他沒有騙你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信羅德島，所以我也相信他，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哦？看來我們是互相說服不了囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但鄭掌櫃可說了，這件事不該再讓你節外生枝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......看你這反應，還真給鯉先生猜中了？掌櫃的和你真是一夥的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你釣我話！？不過是個來路不明的外人，竟敢這麼愚弄本小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，我看不讓你吃點苦頭是不行了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......要動真格的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好呀，我其實也有一些事情要問你——和鯉先生無關的問題就是啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位杜大小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我女兒。不成氣候，讓公子笑話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，既然是前輩的家務事，晚輩不該隨意置喙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鄭前輩在家鄉開了多少客棧酒樓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......畢生積蓄全用來做生意了，所幸這些年，幾個老夥計都還比較照顧我。過去混江湖積累的人脈，也派上了點用處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，闖蕩江湖要看人脈，可最終，還是要靠本事。做生意就是兩碼事了，想起家，要看本事，但想要做大，還真少不了人脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過這些薄物細故，公子也不必知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有的事，家父一直說，晚輩這些年輕後生，缺的不是能耐，不是信念，而是對周遭生活的瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活出一個空中樓閣，總歸不算真的活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左將軍是個好父親。可你父親怎麼認為是沒用的，重點在......你怎麼認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別介意，年少輕狂嘛。真有不服的時候，好奇的時候，鋒芒畢露的時候，也沒啥大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我反倒以為，年輕人，不該太早失了鋒芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受教了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......也不光是說給你聽的，說起來簡單，做起來難，我也是說給自己聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我那女兒喲......頭疼，頭疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。身手還不賴嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......根本就沒碰著你，別裝蒜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼動起手來就和變了個人一樣......小烏有也有這種感覺，你們大炎人都這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想傷人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你眼裡，我們不是偷了東西的賊嗎，對待小偷而言，是不是太溫柔了點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少貧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次不上當了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......那我們互相都坦誠一些，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，我不反對。但提前說好哦，我可沒有替鯉先生發言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無所謂，你和那個神棍似的蓬頭小哥，都不是省油的燈。早點把話說開，對大家都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說你是做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島行動幹員，代號克洛絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那個叫烏有的也是代號囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧。雖然還沒正式入職呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隱姓埋名，笑裡藏刀，你們這些人真是夠裝腔作勢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......我還是第一次被人這麼說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人委託我們拿回那個龍門人手裡的酒盞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大炎話博大精深，我還沒怎麼好好學習，不過“拿回”這個詞，是不是太取巧了點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我信得過鯉先生，如果真有什麼訴求和誤會，為什麼一定要動手呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡可是大炎腹地，又不是敘拉古或者玻利瓦爾之類的地方......暴力可不提倡哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先兵後禮當然是有理由的......不過，你真的什麼都不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀......這次輪到我被套話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是不知道的話......我勸你不要深究為妙。我私下已經找過那個龍門人了，你要是一意孤行，就是壞了所有人的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你倒是光明正大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然我們敢光明正大行事，一定有光明正大的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是話都說到這個份上了，不管你信不信，我都要告訴你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——劫梁府的人不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你知道是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你說你找過鯉先生......那我們暫時休戰？你能答應我，給我們一個合理的交代嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......交代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說那個龍門人是受我們梁大知府所托，從龍門運來了這一隻酒盞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——可委託鏢局的人，恐怕他梁洵也得罪不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其中緣由，剪不斷理還亂，就別指望我告訴你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人！您沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這傢伙，也是來壞我們好事的嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還什麼都沒說啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。話說得也夠多了，本小姐今天就先告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，走了，別和那人糾纏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，說要動手又不打，怎麼每次就知道欺負我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你身手不錯，也明白事理，那本小姐就奉勸你一句——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——山湍澗流，浪急水深！別瞎摻和了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我沒事，別擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜小姐，沒事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那兩個人不是和龍門人一夥的嗎？幹嘛不直接告訴他們真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自有打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鄭老頭想這麼簡單把事情甩給我，沒門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和那個龍門人已經談好了。我看鏢旗風吹雨打這麼些年，也該換換了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
